三年（1758年）竣工，占地面积9308平方米。"},{"id":"57ec180c97c844fba0ebbd17de5cacdf","fdIsExternalLinks":"1","fdExternalLinksUrl":null,"fdColumnId":"5e2445348bd448f08d7fd9835aec5df8","fdTitle":"琼岛春阴碑  Qiongdao spring Yin monument","fdPicture":"temp/琼岛春阴碑_1761622393223.png","fdSubTitle":null,"fdSubTitleTwo":null,"fdAnnex":null,"fdTopping":"2","fdPublishingUnit":null,"fdPublisher":"bhadmin","fdPublishTime":"2025-11-20 12:28:14","fdUpPicture":null,"fdTitleTwo":null,"fdSynopsis":"“琼岛春阴”为金代“燕京八景”之一。"},{"id":"9C8802BA1A4249818ED0A95DDA5653FD","fdIsExternalLinks":"1","fdExternalLinksUrl":null,"fdColumnId":"5e2445348bd448f08d7fd9835aec5df8","fdTitle":"遮荫候  Shading","fdPicture":"temp/遮荫候_1761622048733.png","fdSubTitle":null,"fdSubTitleTwo":null,"fdAnnex":null,"fdTopping":"2","fdPublishingUnit":null,"fdPublisher":"bhadmin","fdPublishTime":"2025-11-20 11:17:09","fdUpPicture":null,"fdTitleTwo":null,"fdSynopsis":"生长在承光殿左侧，是一株10多米高、枝叶茂盛的油松，其姿态苍劲挺拔，如伞盖遮天。相传“遮荫侯”爵位为乾隆皇帝亲封。"},{"id":"a1a20493b83b4ff28793958fdd8aa39f","fdIsExternalLinks":"1","fdExternalLinksUrl":null,"fdColumnId":"5e2445348bd448f08d7fd9835aec5df8","fdTitle":"玉瓮  Jade urn","fdPicture":"temp/玉瓮_1761622108146.png","fdSubTitle":null,"fdSubTitleTwo":null,"fdAnnex":null,"fdTopping":"2","fdPublishingUnit":null,"fdPublisher":"bhadmin","fdPublishTime":"2025-10-28 11:28:31","fdUpPicture":null,"fdTitleTwo":null,"fdSynopsis":"玉瓮又称“渎山大玉海”，制作于至元二年（1265年）。"},{"id":"0a5cc638e98f4f93834b69aaf9160234","fdIsExternalLinks":"1","fdExternalLinksUrl":null,"fdColumnId":"5e2445348bd448f08d7fd9835aec5df8","fdTitle":"白袍将军  White robe general","fdPicture":"temp/白袍将军_1761622163808.png","fdSubTitle":null,"fdSubTitleTwo":null,"fdAnnex":null,"fdTopping":"2","fdPublishingUnit":null,"fdPublisher":"bhadmin","fdPublishTime":"2025-11-20 12:17:34","fdUpPicture":null,"fdTitleTwo":null,"fdSynopsis":"此树为白皮松，相传植于金代。清乾隆皇帝曾封此树为“白袍将军”。白皮松为华北珍贵的观赏树。"},{"id":"e7e394a842ae498ab7884c2aaa08abde","fdIsExternalLinks":"1","fdExternalLinksUrl":null,"fdColumnId":"5e2445348bd448f08d7fd9835aec5df8","fdTitle":"承光殿  Chengguang Temple","fdPicture":"temp/承光殿_1761622007383.png","fdSubTitle":null,"fdSubTitleTwo":null,"fdAnnex":null,"fdTopping":"2","fdPublishingUnit":null,"fdPublisher":"bhadmin","fdPublishTime":"2025-11-20 12:28:42","fdUpPicture":null,"fdTitleTwo":null,"fdSynopsis":null},{"id":"a5a1a9ebfd9c4a1a8c4f0c28068e70a3","fdIsExternalLinks":"1","fdExternalLinksUrl":null,"fdColumnId":"5e2445348bd448f08d7fd9835aec5df8","fdTitle":"团城  Mission City","fdPicture":"temp/团城_1761622271652.png","fdSubTitle":null,"fdSubTitleTwo":null,"fdAnnex":null,"fdTopping":"2","fdPublishingUnit":null,"fdPublisher":"bhadmin","fdPublishTime":"2025-10-28 11:31:16","fdUpPicture":null,"fdTitleTwo":null,"fdSynopsis":"团城原是太液池中的一个小岛，金代为大宁宫一部分。元代称圆坻，亦称瀛洲。"},{"id":"d382dab53c1442f49c5299e2f03442ff","fdIsExternalLinks":"1","fdExternalLinksUrl":null,"fdColumnId":"5e2445348bd448f08d7fd9835aec5df8","fdTitle":"阅古楼  unknow","fdPicture":"temp/IMGL0933(1)_1763559381217.jpg","fdSubTitle":null,"fdSubTitleTwo":null,"fdAnnex":null,"fdTopping":"2","fdPublishingUnit":null,"fdPublisher":"bhadmin","fdPublishTime":"2025-11-20 11:41:19","fdUpPicture":null,"fdTitleTwo":null,"fdSynopsis":"阅古楼，清乾隆十八年（1753年）为保存《三希堂法帖》石刻而建，平面作半月形，上下两层，延楼二十五楹，左右围抱。"},{"id":"e61f3858b4654c42948bee513d1f733f","fdIsExternalLinks":"1","fdExternalLinksUrl":null,"fdColumnId":"5e2445348bd448f08d7fd9835aec5df8","fdTitle":"永安寺  Yongan Temple","fdPicture":"temp/永安寺_1761622435091.png,temp/微信图片_20251119204341_64_123(1)_1763556899778.jpg","fdSubTitle":null,"fdSubTitleTwo":null,"fdAnnex":null,"fdTopping":"2","fdPublishingUnit":null,"fdPublisher":"bhadmin","fdPublishTime":"2025-11-19 20:56:34","fdUpPicture":null,"fdTitleTwo":null,"fdSynopsis":"永安寺位于北海白塔山南麓。始建于清顺治八年（1651年）。"},{"id":"4d8a6c27a86d4746948af8b1f85e18e8","fdIsExternalLinks":"1","fdExternalLinksUrl":null,"fdColumnId":"5e2445348bd448f08d7fd9835aec5df8","fdTitle":"先蚕坛  First silkworm altar","fdPicture":"temp/先蚕坛_1761622479257.png","fdSubTitle":null,"fdSubTitleTwo":null,"fdAnnex":null,"fdTopping":"2","fdPublishingUnit":null,"fdPublisher":"bhadmin","fdPublishTime":"2025-11-20 11:44:20","fdUpPicture":null,"fdTitleTwo":null,"fdSynopsis":"先蚕坛是北京九坛之一，是现存较完整的一处皇室祭祀“蚕神”的地方。"},{"id":"d9d392e933884262bff657fca64602a6","fdIsExternalLinks":"1","fdExternalLinksUrl":null,"fdColumnId":"5e2445348bd448f08d7fd9835aec5df8","fdTitle":"画舫斋  Painting zhai fasting","fdPicture":"temp/画舫斋_1761622536375.png","fdSubTitle":null,"fdSubTitleTwo":null,"fdAnnex":null,"fdTopping":"2","fdPublishingUnit":null,"fdPublisher":"bhadmin","fdPublishTime":"2025-11-20 12:13:14","fdUpPicture":null,"fdTitleTwo":null,"fdSynopsis":"建于清乾隆二十二年（公元1757年），原据欧阳修的《画舫斋记》而造其形、得其名。"},{"id":"1eec059c1d0d46d5848c836684de754f","fdIsExternalLinks":"1","fdExternalLinksUrl":null,"fdColumnId":"5e2445348bd448f08d7fd9835aec5df8","fdTitle":"濠濮间  Ho Pu between","fdPicture":"temp/濠濮间_1761629643846.png","fdSubTitle":null,"fdSubTitleTwo":null,"fdAnnex":null,"fdTopping":"2","fdPublishingUnit":null,"fdPublisher":"bhadmin","fdPublishTime":"2025-11-20 12:09:38","fdUpPicture":null,"fdTitleTwo":null,"fdSynopsis":"濠濮间位于北海东岸的画舫斋和春雨林塘之南，与画舫斋和春雨林塘同期建成，殿宇和游廊均为灰筒瓦屋面。占地面积4416平方米，建筑面积350.12平方米。\n"},{"id":"e5a54b29853949c8b919f2eb2a29337a","fdIsExternalLinks":"1","fdExternalLinksUrl":null,"fdColumnId":"5e2445348bd448f08d7fd9835aec5df8","fdTitle":"五龙亭  Wulong Ting","fdPicture":"temp/五龙亭_1761629690760.png","fdSubTitle":null,"fdSubTitleTwo":null,"fdAnnex":null,"fdTopping":"2","fdPublishingUnit":null,"fdPublisher":"bhadmin","fdPublishTime":"2025-11-20 11:46:56","fdUpPicture":null,"fdTitleTwo":null,"fdSynopsis":"五龙亭位于北海太液池西北隅，建于明嘉靖朝（1522-1566年），中为龙泽亭，左为涌瑞亭、浮翠亭；右为澄祥亭、滋香亭。\n"},{"id":"3d515bb55280465c9bf0b6bb0f6bbb5b","fdIsExternalLinks":"1","fdExternalLinksUrl":null,"fdColumnId":"5e2445348bd448f08d7fd9835aec5df8","fdTitle":"西天梵境  West Vatican","fdPicture":"temp/西天梵境_1761629726351.png","fdSubTitle":null,"fdSubTitleTwo":null,"fdAnnex":null,"fdTopping":"2","fdPublishingUnit":null,"fdPublisher":"bhadmin","fdPublishTime":"2025-11-20 12:06:47","fdUpPicture":null,"fdTitleTwo":null,"fdSynopsis":"“西天梵境”又称大西天，东临静心斋，西与大圆境智宝殿相依，南与琼华岛贯成一线，是北海最负盛名的景区之一。"},{"id":"88c99c368b504ecc9835a745fd168d25","fdIsExternalLinks":"1","fdExternalLinksUrl":null,"fdColumnId":"5e2445348bd448f08d7fd9835aec5df8","fdTitle":"快雪堂书法博物馆  Quick snow hall","fdPicture":"temp/快雪堂书法博物馆_1761629791932.png","fdSubTitle":null,"fdSubTitleTwo":null,"fdAnnex":null,"fdTopping":"2","fdPublishingUnit":null,"fdPublisher":"bhadmin","fdPublishTime":"2025-10-28 13:36:41","fdUpPicture":null,"fdTitleTwo":null,"fdSynopsis":"快雪堂为三进院落，分别为澄观堂、浴兰轩、快雪堂，院内四周由彩绘游廊连接。其中，澄观堂、浴兰轩建于清乾隆十一年（1746年），是皇帝的行宫。乾隆四十四年（1779年），乾隆皇帝为收藏48方书法石刻，特增建快雪堂院落， 1923年，为纪念讨袁护国运动的著名将领蔡锷（字松坡）将军，经黎元洪批准，将快雪堂三进院落拨作“松坡图书馆”第一馆，梁启超出任馆长，第一馆专藏中文书籍（石虎胡同成立第二馆藏外文书籍）。\n"},{"id":"0f640d0a13234781be93c9aa2797852a","fdIsExternalLinks":"1","fdExternalLinksUrl":null,"fdColumnId":"5e2445348bd448f08d7fd9835aec5df8","fdTitle":"九龙壁  Kowloon wall","fdPicture":"temp/九龙壁_1761629833956.png","fdSubTitle":null,"fdSubTitleTwo":null,"fdAnnex":null,"fdTopping":"2","fdPublishingUnit":null,"fdPublisher":"bhadmin","fdPublishTime":"2025-11-20 12:01:21","fdUpPicture":null,"fdTitleTwo":null,"fdSynopsis":"九龙壁是原大圆镜智宝殿前的影壁，建于乾隆二十一年（1756年）。壁高5.96米，厚1.60米，长25.52米。壁的两面用七色琉璃砖瓦镶砌而成。\n"},{"id":"845f0705cde44c51a0afe1fd2d2f5566","fdIsExternalLinks":"1","fdExternalLinksUrl":null,"fdColumnId":"5e2445348bd448f08d7fd9835aec5df8","fdTitle":"铜仙承露盘  Tongxian exposed plate","fdPicture":"temp/铜仙承露盘_1761622313766.png","fdSubTitle":null,"fdSubTitleTwo":null,"fdAnnex":null,"fdTopping":"2","fdPublishingUnit":null,"fdPublisher":"bhadmin","fdPublishTime":"2025-11-26 16:12:21","fdUpPicture":null,"fdTitleTwo":null,"fdSynopsis":"铜仙承露盘是清乾隆皇帝仿汉武帝故事而建。于石座上竖汉白玉蟠龙柱，柱顶端立一双手托盘的铜人，通高6.6米。"},{"id":"51faaa2e109843ef86d85ea8e47ecd5d","fdIsExternalLinks":"1","fdExternalLinksUrl":null,"fdColumnId":"5e2445348bd448f08d7fd9835aec5df8","fdTitle":"铁影壁  Iron wall","fdPicture":"temp/铁影壁_1761629870242.png","fdSubTitle":null,"fdSubTitleTwo":null,"fdAnnex":null,"fdTopping":"2","fdPublishingUnit":null,"fdPublisher":"bhadmin","fdPublishTime":"2025-11-26 16:14:27","fdUpPicture":null,"fdTitleTwo":null,"fdSynopsis":"元代遗物，壁呈棕褐色，由中性火山块砾岩雕成，因颜色和质地似铁，故称铁影壁。\n"},{"id":"26b8aa802284431c82905aed52581a75","fdIsExternalLinks":"1","fdExternalLinksUrl":null,"fdColumnId":"5e2445348bd448f08d7fd9835aec5df8","fdTitle":"小西天  Little West","fdPicture":"temp/小西天_1761629907793.png","fdSubTitle":null,"fdSubTitleTwo":null,"fdAnnex":null,"fdTopping":"2","fdPublishingUnit":null,"fdPublisher":"bhadmin","fdPublishTime":"2025-11-26 16:13:50","fdUpPicture":null,"fdTitleTwo":null,"fdSynopsis":"小西天始建于清乾隆三十三年（公元1768 年），建成于清乾隆三十五年（公元1770 年），是清乾隆皇帝为母亲孝圣皇太后祝寿祈福而建的\n\n\n"},{"id":"8d8a18c6964743309fd6688a83af3a04","fdIsExternalLinks":"1","fdExternalLinksUrl":null,"fdColumnId":"5e2445348bd448f08d7fd9835aec5df8","fdTitle":"智珠殿  Pearl house","fdPicture":"temp/智珠殿_1761622218147.png","fdSubTitle":null,"fdSubTitleTwo":null,"fdAnnex":null,"fdTopping":"2","fdPublishingUnit":null,"fdPublisher":"bhadmin","fdPublishTime":"2025-11-20 12:22:42","fdUpPicture":null,"fdTitleTwo":null,"fdSynopsis":"智珠殿，半月城位于琼岛东麓山脚下，坐西面东与陟山桥相对，建于乾隆十六年（1751年）。\n"}],"children":[]}},"siteSetting":{"id":"b91a543a5c3c48488c8cf7e86d0b4700","createBy":"admin","updateDate":null,"tenantId":"0","updateBy":"admin","delFlag":0,"createDate":"2025-08-08 00:00:00","fdBackgroundImg":null,"fdFlowdesc":null,"fdTheme":"0","fdTopImg":null,"fdFlowstatus":null,"fdLogoImg":"temp/logo2_1756259834278.png","fdRemarks":"1","fdVersion":null,"fdSiteName":"北海公园主站","fdSiteTitle":"北海公园主站"},"pageSetting":{"id":"500722b7bbc046d986853f7129fecd3d","tenantId":"0","createBy":"admin","createTime":"2025-08-11 13:58:19","updateBy":"admin","updateTime":"2025-11-05 17:21:17","sysOrgCode":"A01","delFlag":"0","fdFlowstatus":0,"fdFlowdesc":"0","fdTaskid":"0","fdSubmit":0,"fdSiteId":"b91a543a5c3c48488c8cf7e86d0b4700","fdSort":null,"fdColumnRet":null,"fdDataCode":"explore","fdDataName":"探索","fdExtendInfo":null},"explore-hycs":{"fdPositionRet":0,"fdPositionCount":0,"fdColumnRet":0,"fdColumnId":"f949dcc802b84bd7b429707bd8a3552a","fdPageSettingId":"500722b7bbc046d986853f7129fecd3d","fdDataCode":"explore-hycs","fdDesc":null,"columnInfo":{"id":"f949dcc802b84bd7b429707bd8a3552a","sysOrgCode":"A03","fdSiteId":"b91a543a5c3c48488c8cf7e86d0b4700","fdExternalLinksUrl":null,"pid":"ba27373124604a0a8f882da30f926ebc","fdColumnName":"花园城市","fdIsExternalLinks":"N","fdRemarks":null,"hasChild":"0","fdPicture":null,"fdUser":null,"fdBrowserType":null,"fdUploadType":null,"fdColumnHeadingStyle":null,"fdShowArticleTitle":null,"fdExtendInfo":null,"fdBannerPic":null,"fdInfoColumn":"1","articleList":[],"children":[]}},"explore-kpbh":{"fdPositionRet":0,"fdPositionCount":0,"fdColumnRet":0,"fdColumnId":"8589478f692e4184901c0f775bc3aee8","fdPageSettingId":"500722b7bbc046d986853f7129fecd3d","fdDataCode":"explore-kpbh","fdDesc":null,"columnInfo":{"id":"8589478f692e4184901c0f775bc3aee8","sysOrgCode":"A01","fdSiteId":"b91a543a5c3c48488c8cf7e86d0b4700","fdExternalLinksUrl":null,"pid":"ba27373124604a0a8f882da30f926ebc","fdColumnName":"科普北海","fdIsExternalLinks":"N","fdRemarks":null,"hasChild":"1","fdPicture":null,"fdUser":null,"fdBrowserType":null,"fdUploadType":"3","fdColumnHeadingStyle":null,"fdShowArticleTitle":"0","fdExtendInfo":null,"fdBannerPic":"temp/explore-background-banner_1756107374072.png","fdInfoColumn":"1","articleList":[],"children":[]}},"explore-lsgk":{"fdPositionRet":0,"fdPositionCount":0,"fdColumnRet":0,"fdColumnId":"092d21767c414b5d920b89242d1f5e9f","fdPageSettingId":"500722b7bbc046d986853f7129fecd3d","fdDataCode":"explore-lsgk","fdDesc":null,"columnInfo":{"id":"092d21767c414b5d920b89242d1f5e9f","sysOrgCode":"A01","fdSiteId":"b91a543a5c3c48488c8cf7e86d0b4700","fdExternalLinksUrl":null,"pid":"ba27373124604a0a8f882da30f926ebc","fdColumnName":"历史概括","fdIsExternalLinks":"N","fdRemarks":null,"hasChild":"0","fdPicture":null,"fdUser":null,"fdBrowserType":null,"fdUploadType":"3","fdColumnHeadingStyle":null,"fdShowArticleTitle":"0","fdExtendInfo":"{\n\t\"introduction\": \"北海位于北京城的中心，是中国现存历史上建园最早、保存最完整、文化沉积最深厚的古典皇家园林。北海的形成和发展历经金、元、明、清数个朝代，承载着中国近千年的历史和文化，形成了以皇家园林为代表的造园艺术风格，它是凝聚着历代园林文化艺术之大成的杰作。\",\n\t\"history\": {\n\t\t\"events\": [\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\"year\": \"1166年\",\n\t\t\t\t\"dynasty\": \"金代\",\n\"desc\": \"金大定六年\\n世宗完颜雍命少府监丞张仅言主持在城北大兴土木营建皇家离宫——太宁宫。\\n是至今北海有确切历史记载之始！\\n大定十九年（1179年）\\n世宗幸太宁宫，标志太宁宫建成。\"\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\"year\": \"1215年\",\n\t\t\t\t\"dynasty\": \"元代\",\n\"desc\": \"元代至元年间，忽必烈建设一座新的都城——元大都。\\n琼华岛及其所在的湖泊被划入大都皇城之中，成为皇城御苑。。\"\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\"year\": \"1460年\",\n\t\t\t\t\"dynasty\": \"明代\",\n\"desc\": \"明代，明成祖朱棣于永乐年间下诏迁都北京。\\n北海园林成为明皇室游幸、读书的重要场所，明代一些大臣和文人学士也曾得到明帝赏赐，游览园林并留下过很多游记。\"\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\"year\": \"1651年\",\n\t\t\t\t\"dynasty\": \"清代\",\n\"desc\": \"清代曾对北海园林进行大规模修缮与扩建。\\n特别是乾隆时期，进行了长达38年的营建，规模巨大、工期漫长、耗资无数，使北海园林的发展达到鼎盛时期，奠定了此后北海园林的规模和格局。\"\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t]\n\t}\n}","fdBannerPic":"temp/explore-background-banner_1755494684499.png","fdInfoColumn":"0","articleList":[],"children":[]}}},"timestamp":1791458980688}